{#- The decision as an agent reads it back: each draft with what to do with
    it, its recipients, and the final text to send or to rewrite from, then
    what the person changed and why. A draft without a decision is not
    sent. The app prints the head (title, origin, who decided, the note to
    the agent) before this. -#}
{%- if data.drafts %}
## Drafts
{% for d in data.drafts %}
{%- set draft = review.payload.drafts | selectattr("id", "equalto", d.id) | first %}
- **`{{ d.id }}` {{ d.action | verb }}** — {{ d.subject }}
{%- if draft %}
  To: {{ draft.to | join(", ") }}{% if draft.cc %}; Cc: {{ draft.cc | join(", ") }}{% endif %}{% if draft.bcc %}; Bcc: {{ draft.bcc | join(", ") }}{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{%- if d.action != "discard" %}
  Body:

    {{ d.body | indent(4) }}
{%- endif %}
{%- for e in d.edits or [] %}
  - {% if not e.from %}added “{{ e.to }}”{% elif not e.to %}removed “{{ e.from }}”{% else %}“{{ e.from }}” → “{{ e.to }}”{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- for c in d.comments or [] %}
  - on “{{ c.quote }}”: {{ c.note }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- if d.note %}
  > {{ d.note }}
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{% endif -%}
{%- if data.undecided %}
Not decided, so not to be sent: {% for id in data.undecided %}`{{ id }}`{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% endif -%}
